understanding of the module topics. Furthermore, lab practice lessons will be held for
presentation and discussion of the assignments. Furthermore, these practice lessons serve to
align implementation and the corresponding theory (which is mainly the content of the
lecture).
Professional competencies: After successful completion of the module, students are able to implement
